<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Thank you for your hard work, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama."<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花笑顔.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Ah, it seems the interference noise has finally cleared. My form, too, should be visible as it was before."<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Now, through their cooperation, Shigatsu Youka has been destroyed."<PG>
"It seems it was all a scheme of Shigatsu Youka, which abused Itohime's pure wish for its own growth and prosperity."<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日目閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Come to think of it, it began with the flayed-body case in Motoki-cho, then the use of Droga in the Megasawa City case. And further, the blood infection that began with my father, Eiichiro Niimura."<PG>
"Not knowing it was Shigatsu Youka's trap, humans relied on that alluring drug, and as a result they were struck by those many tragedies."<PG>
"Be it the flaying case or the Megasawa City case, from Shigatsu Youka's point of view those were only the smallest of events."<PG>
"That they could avoid those, steer clear of tragedy and arrive here may well be called the result of their efforts to be in the right, even if only a little."<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"But a few small mysteries still remain. Do you remember what they were?"
{PAUSE ""}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
